# =========================
# AI War 2 汉化项目 .gitignore
# =========================

# ---------- 默认排除一切 ----------
*

# ---------- 根级文件 ----------
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!AIWar2_CHINESE_TRANSLATION_SPEC.md

# ---------- 编译后的 DLL ----------
!PatchedAssemblies/
!PatchedAssemblies/**

# ---------- 翻译后的 XML ----------
!GameData/
!GameData/Configuration/
!GameData/Configuration/**

# ---------- 排除非翻译文件 ----------
GameData/Configuration/**/*.metadata
GameData/Configuration/**/*.bmp
GameData/Configuration/**/*.json
GameData/Configuration/**/*.csproj
GameData/Configuration/**/*.user

# ---------- 敏感文件 ----------
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.env
*.credentials
*.secret

# ---------- 操作系统文件 ----------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
